      "description": "Tools สำหรับ IAM Team ใช้ในการ reset user password\n\nh2. Details\n\n* Export the changed password result to a .csv file and send it to email (eg. [iam@domain.tld|mailto:iam@domain.tld])\n* Support bulk process (can reset the password of a user in multiple hosts)\n* No one knows about the password if not include the email loop\n\nh2. Support platform\n\n* Linux user\n* Windows user\n* Database user\n\nh1. Init information\n\nh2. Input\n\n* Target Type (Linux, Windows, Database)\n* Target Hosts (Just one or multiple)\n* Username (eg. klprocjob)\n* Password (Can optional)\n* Random Password Length (min: 20)\n\nTentative timeline : 1 May 2025\n\n\n\nย้ายจาก Jira ของเดิมมา\n\n!Screenshot 2025-04-17 at 14.39.17.png|width=681,height=552,alt=\"Screenshot 2025-04-17 at 14.39.17.png\"!",
